{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Hey Sam, hope you're doing good. Something funny happened last night."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-1ce1762491872389ef575c6c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.368829+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1ce1762491872389ef575c6c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1ce1762491872389ef575c6c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Hey Evan, what's up? What happened? Let me know."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-14e581fbc532e869e96ee9dd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.393449+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "14e581fbc532e869e96ee9dd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "14e581fbc532e869e96ee9dd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yesterday I went out with my friends and had a bit too much to drink. I ended up doing something I regret and it involved someone's roses."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-5af324fc7a7df95f2d1d5dc4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.403585+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5af324fc7a7df95f2d1d5dc4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5af324fc7a7df95f2d1d5dc4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: What's up with that incident? All good now?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-18aa006f5a07f9c115eb2a17", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.410527+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "18aa006f5a07f9c115eb2a17", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "18aa006f5a07f9c115eb2a17", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Oof, Sam, so embarrassing! I had a pee accident near some roses - can you believe it? I'm so sorry about that."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-890196d7008ae1c021bd0d3d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.426600+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "890196d7008ae1c021bd0d3d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "890196d7008ae1c021bd0d3d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Uh oh, Evan! That's awkward. Did anyone get mad at you? Are you okay?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-f47b80a73694a5b69a11a2fc", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.441602+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "f47b80a73694a5b69a11a2fc", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "f47b80a73694a5b69a11a2fc", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I was so embarrassed when I saw what happened the next morning, so I apologized and luckily they were understanding. Yeah, I was out of control--guess I gotta be more careful next time."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-34b9aeaadcd8cac0ddb0c7f2", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.452942+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "34b9aeaadcd8cac0ddb0c7f2", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "34b9aeaadcd8cac0ddb0c7f2", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: They were understanding? Phew! We all mess up sometimes, we're human after all."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-27fc3741bb7f65251edfe857", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.467121+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "27fc3741bb7f65251edfe857", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "27fc3741bb7f65251edfe857", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yeah, they were understanding, which was great. But it's a good reminder to be more careful. We all make mistakes, but it's important to learn from them. Speaking of, my partner and I tried snowshoeing this weekend. It was part of a new adventure for us and surprisingly fun."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-da9f9edba7d1c1053535487f", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.478807+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "da9f9edba7d1c1053535487f", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "da9f9edba7d1c1053535487f", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Yeah, Evan, you're right. Mistakes happen, but it's good to learn from them. Snowshoeing sounds like a great way to stay active during the winter. I've been thinking and I made a meal plan and workout schedule. I'm getting motivated by something I saw, so starting today I'm gonna do my best to stay on track."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-a88b22ffc3124e86537f4b91", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.492988+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a88b22ffc3124e86537f4b91", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a88b22ffc3124e86537f4b91", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Good work, Sam! You've got a plan and you're dedicated to staying healthy - have you asked your doctor for advice? They could probably give you even more diet and exercise tips."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-3704f3a228c4c3cc9ff9e5b8", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.510656+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "3704f3a228c4c3cc9ff9e5b8", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "3704f3a228c4c3cc9ff9e5b8", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks, Evan! Haven't seen a doctor in a while, but it's probably a good idea to get some advice. I'm going to make an appointment soon."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-7b02ad132a11a5cab3ef7a83", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.524133+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7b02ad132a11a5cab3ef7a83", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7b02ad132a11a5cab3ef7a83", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: What advice are you planning to get from the doctor?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-7761dd3bf02c060d7b2d0b7b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.536158+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7761dd3bf02c060d7b2d0b7b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7761dd3bf02c060d7b2d0b7b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: I'm gonna ask the doc about a balanced diet plan and getting advice on low-impact exercises, given my current situation."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-bfb455a58a87790f88411e81", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.547306+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "bfb455a58a87790f88411e81", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "bfb455a58a87790f88411e81", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Sounds good, Sam. That's definitely a step in the right direction. Remember to focus on a balanced diet and low-impact exercises. Let me know how it goes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-a6df14b32f238198a7c2e512", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.561052+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "a6df14b32f238198a7c2e512", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "a6df14b32f238198a7c2e512", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That looks great! Where did you get the idea for this salad? Also, do you have any suggestions for low-impact exercises?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-8e1da39e6c523c7440260ced", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.573778+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "8e1da39e6c523c7440260ced", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "8e1da39e6c523c7440260ced", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I got it from a nearby restaurant. As for low-impact exercises, swimming, yoga, and walking are good options."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-af200a2455a92cfb740ba1c7", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.584795+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "af200a2455a92cfb740ba1c7", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "af200a2455a92cfb740ba1c7", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: The salad idea from a restaurant is a smart move, Evan! And thanks for the exercise tips. Also I watched The Godfather last night, and it motivated me to keep up with my routine. \"I'm gonna make him an offer he can't refuse\" - now that's motivation!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-1717363364f6f2a92faae2bf", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.596649+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1717363364f6f2a92faae2bf", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1717363364f6f2a92faae2bf", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: Yoga's definitely a great start, Sam. It's helped me with stress and staying flexible, which is perfect alongside the diet. And yes, The Godfather is a legendary thing to watch, can be re-watched many times!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-02b5cf5ab672643c6a9a7cbd", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.610307+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "02b5cf5ab672643c6a9a7cbd", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "02b5cf5ab672643c6a9a7cbd", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Between a healthier diet and yoga, I\u2019m hoping for some positive changes."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-2a84cd8039250a431d87d972", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.623070+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "2a84cd8039250a431d87d972", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "2a84cd8039250a431d87d972", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: By the way there are plenty of other low-impact exercises that can be fun. Going on beach sunsets is one of my favorites - good for exercise and totally calming."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-0abf9efad5b1fbdec7290da4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.634331+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0abf9efad5b1fbdec7290da4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0abf9efad5b1fbdec7290da4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: That looks zen. Gonna go for some beach walks - thanks for the tip, Evan! I want to brag, I had that recurring dream again where I'm flying over skyscrapers!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-dbbcb2307263f5facdb076b4", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.646194+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "dbbcb2307263f5facdb076b4", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "dbbcb2307263f5facdb076b4", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Evan: I think a little more and you'll learn how to control those dreams, once you get the hang of it let me know haha! Enjoy the fresh air and the views. Have fun!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-75a4af0779285bbea3dbb18c", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.659792+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "75a4af0779285bbea3dbb18c", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "75a4af0779285bbea3dbb18c", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Sam: Thanks Evan! Gonna make the most of it. You too, have a good one!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-49/session_24-20669bfdfc12ed103703c740", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:00:32.672861+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "20669bfdfc12ed103703c740", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "20669bfdfc12ed103703c740", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
